02:00038ECE 101D            	  2118:     move.b  (A5)+,D0  ; PLA
02:00038ED0 4EB900030DBC    	  2119:     jsr     DrawObjectNotMirrored
02:00038ED6 60008250        	  2120:     jmp     CheckMonsterCollisions
