                            	  2152: SecretArmosXs:
02:00038F04 E0              	  2153:     dc.b    $E0, $B0, $B0, $30, $40, $90, $A0
02:00038F05 B0
02:00038F06 B0
02:00038F07 30
02:00038F08 40
02:00038F09 90
02:00038F0A A0
