02:00039B0C 00039B1C        	  3824:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039B10 00039B1C        	  3825:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00039B14 00039B1C        	  3826:     dc.l    Moldorm_Chase   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
